WEBVTT

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.860
Ah, that much-talked-about...

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.150
You're telling me to disgrace myself?

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.210
You best just give up.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.740
"Incompetent talented girl."

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.540
Perhaps they've gotten lost.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:01.330
Where am I...?

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.630
My outfit has changed yet again.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.420
Welcome to "Walter's Illusory Tale."

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.540
Mule!

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.790
Can you keep quiet and behave yourself?

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.420
It's about to begin.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.170
"Begin"?

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:19.550
Lita...

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:21.540
Elli!

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:25.920
Quiet, please.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.820
What is all this?

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:38.280
Welcome to the Queen of Hearts' court.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:41.240
I presume you're Melida 
Angel, the girl in question.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.960
Yes, "Big Brother."

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:49.870
That is without question the daughter
of the head House of Angel.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.040
Very good!

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.830
Then, let the trial now begin.

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:59.080
Pride of an Assassin-Instructor

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.790
"Trial"?

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:11.940
That man is the judge as well as the
ringleader behind this conspiracy.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:17.740
It was under his instruction that I lead
you and the others here, Melida.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.500
I see...

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.540
I don't know who you are 
or where you come from,

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.800
but I won't bow my head to a king

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:30.710
who hides his face with a mask and 
is unwilling to reveal his lineage.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:35.380
We're still in the middle of our certification exam,
so I'll be going now.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:40.000
You cannot flee,
imposter daughter of the House of Angel.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:42.750
Clerk, please prepare to start recording.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.040
Once Upon a Time.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:52.120
"Anders' Codex" here is 
a magical text that will

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.690
accurately chronicle all 
the events as they unfold.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:58.690
So you best be careful about your
choice of words of here.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:03.960
Otherwise you'll end up delighting the public
with a Knight-Duke House-related scandal.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.360
There is a single charge against you.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:14.920
The defendant, Melida Angel, in spite of having
no qualification to be in a Knight-Duke House,

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.250
is suspected of laying claim 
to the Angel family name

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:22.840
and deceiving the people of Flandore
over the course of 13 years.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.540
You damn "incompetent talented girl"!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.930
Such a thing is unforgivable!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:28.540
Precisely!

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:33.210
However, the time to shed light on
her crimes has finally come.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:38.980
The man who says he is her true father
has appeared and taken center stage.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:40.900
And furthermore...

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.200
We have here proof that the
defendant's lineage is improper.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.830
That's my...

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.050
"Name: Melida Angel."

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.880
Her Class is...

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.540
Oh my...

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.170
"Samurai."

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.460
I knew it!

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.330
So, that girl really is...

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.120
While it may be true my Class is Samurai,

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.680
that's not evidence that I'm 
not my father's daughter.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:09.420
My instructor taught me that.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.330
Even when one is born 
into a Knight-Duke House,

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.210
there are cases in which they
don't inherit a higher-ranked Class!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:18.040
You are indeed correct.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:21.780
However, there is something I just
can't wrap my head around.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.420
Why is it that you were an "incompetent talented girl"
who didn't have any mana?

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:31.330
And why only now at the age of 13 did
your mana suddenly awaken?

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.130
Th-that's because...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.920
That's because what?!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.790
Why did your mana manifest all of a sudden?!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:41.080
If anyone finds out about what happened...

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.920
See! She can't offer a reply!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.630
She has a guilty conscience, after all!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.000
Th-that's not true!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.510
Sure about that?!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.000
Deep down even you know, don't you?

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.330
That, having been labeled an 
"incompetent talented girl,"

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:56.020
you're unworthy of being 
part of a Knight-Duke House!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.630
It's clear as day now!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.730
Melida Angel's father is not Duke Felgus!

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.130
This is absolutely unbearable!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.740
When the two of them married,

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.780
Duke Felgus had people from all 
quarters running him ragged.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:12.000
What a little hussy she was 
to betray that devotion!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.070
Sure enough, shouldn't the 
vulgar commoners be expelled to

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.340
the lower-social-stratum living quarters

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:21.210
and Flandore kept as the 
domain of us nobles alone?!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.090
Shut up...

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.380
SHUT UP!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.000
Don't you speak ill of my mother and father!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.350
I remember it all.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:35.850
My mother sincerely loved me and my father!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.280
I refuse to believe I'm 
the product of an affair!

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.670
Then, why is your mana-

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.710
I will prove that to you!

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.000
I'll get more and more 
powerful, join Crest Legion,

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.050
become the kind of child of the 
House of Angel who's acknowledged

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:49.660
by people all over the country,

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.880
and attest to the love that 
my mother and father shared!

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.540
Lita...

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.960
I will absolutely not give in!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:04.460
I'll be damned if I lose to you all!

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.630
Then you should prove it to us.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:17.790
Let's see whether you're truly a match for
someone from a Knight-Duke House.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.960
Salacha...?

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.210
Go now, my loyal knight Jack!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:29.750
Expose the deception that has grown
rampant in the House of Angel!

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:33.250
If possible, I wanted to put a stop
to this before it went this far...

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:36.960
Wait!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.080
Cut it out, Salacha!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.170
Lita!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.290
Thanks!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.220
Now that it's come to this, 
I'm left with no choice.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:52.630
At best I can end this 
quickly by my own hand.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:55.580
I can at least take pride in that!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:06:59.770
Lita!

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.960
Please don't put up a struggle.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.110
I have no desire to see your blood.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.080
How very kind of you.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:12.160
But you best not underestimate 
the Samurai Class!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.130
The Dragoon ability of flight...

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.590
Springily Rain!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.130
Lita!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.960
She seems to be trying her best, at least.

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:37.180
Too bad Melida doesn't have a
chance in a million of winning.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:42.380
I mean, right from the beginning she's getting
pinned down by Sala, a Dragoon Class.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:49.040
She's not a Paladin Class,
and if moreover she suffers an overwhelming defeat

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.630
to a fellow daughter of a
Knight-Duke House who's her same age,

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:56.800
there will be no one left who believes she's
descended from the House of Angel.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.500
You reek of lies.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.710
Lita boasted about you to me.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.750
She said she had gotten to 
know a really pretty girl.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.790
She said she felt like you might
become a special kind of friend.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.000
Oh, I see.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.460
But, I bet she hates me now.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.470
That's your real intention.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:22.750
So long as she has a friend like you by her side,
I'm sure Melida will be fine.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:25.600
You really like Lita, don't you?

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.920
If you think of Lita and look down on her,

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.610
I will stand behind her and support her.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.170
I take pride in that!

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.000
She's dominating.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.920
Take a look at that!

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.960
How unsightly it is to be unable to
do anything more than run away!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.290
Those with addled eyes see that
and think she's dominating?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.080
Just who the hell is he?

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:53.800
That man who trains her...

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.080
No, Salacha!

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.100
No more taking refuge in the sky!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.020
Sala!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.740
Lady Salacha lost?!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:16.860
Now, you all listen to me!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:24.630
I take pride in being Samurai Class!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.790
It is because I'm a Samurai that
I was able to pick myself up,

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.810
and it's because there's 
someone I want to catch up

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.750
with that I can find the 
courage to push forward.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.210
Staying true to myself,

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:38.090
I'll get everyone to accept me just as I am.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.670
I am a Paladin of the House of Angel!

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:52.330
U-uh, If... by any chance at all...

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.500
Lady Melida truly is the 
daughter of Duke Felgus

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:59.880
and the late awakening of her mana and
difference in Class was simply bad luck...

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:04.580
Wouldn't it mean we've done
something extremely treasonous?

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:09.170
Once she's backed into a corner, 
she's of no use at all.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.790
I suppose I'll make it as 
if this never happened.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.000
Is that...?!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.500
Melida!

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.210
What's that?!

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:46.380
An "Alternate Fountain Pen"!

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:50.460
It's a super-rare non-standard item that
can rewrite the effects of magical texts!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.750
What's Sala doing with something like that?!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.040
What should we be doing now?!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.210
We're mana users, you know!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:14.330
Melida is absolutely right.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.420
Playtime is over now.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:19.330
Okay!

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:25.630
Everyone in the gallery, this is the way out!

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:26.830
Hurry, everybody!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:27.830
Get on the other side of the door!

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.610
Mrs. Othello?

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.290
Uh, I-I...

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.710
Please quickly take refuge.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:43.500
Elli will be troubled if you don't
return home to the mansion.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.790
Quickly, now! We need to go, too!

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.080
Come, come...

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.030
beautiful princesses!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.830
Isn't it about time for the 
finale of this fairy tale?

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.380
You're...!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:21.510
My current role is not as "Melida 
Angel's imposter father."

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.750
It is as "complete unadulterated evil."

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.710
Sure enough, you are an imposter!

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.710
How dare you torment Lita like you did!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.750
It's eroding it?

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.210
It's time to put an end to this!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:40.280
Elli!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.830
Lita...

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.380
Elli, I'll protect you.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:52.250
Now let me hear...

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.250
the despair-filled shriek of a young lady!

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.750
Instructor...

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.880
Sorry I took so long, Lady Melida.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.600
Leave the rest to me.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.540
No, Instructor.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.440
I am also going to protect everyone!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.040
That's the kind of thing 
that makes you my pupil.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.500
Let's do this, milady!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.670
Okay!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.000
I suspected that you would come,

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.830
private tutor of Melida Angel.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.920
As if I care.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.460
Now, scram.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:57.850
When did you...?!

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:09.080
Too slow.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.380
It's taking you three seconds 
to unleash your mana.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.330
Understood.

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.130
What's a bastard like you gonna-

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.080
Don't make light of the Samurai Class.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.960
Thousand Blade: Brilliant Severing-Petal!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:10.500
Instructor!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.170
Miu...

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.000
Oh my, how careless of me.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:57.040
Those two are so passionate 
they couldn't resist.

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:08.880
Damn it! Ouch! It hurts!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.130
Stop making a fuss and being so unseemly.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.510
Duke!

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:18.040
Though it happened within a tale,
you suffered death, so you bet it hurts.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.040
Save me, Duke!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.710
I get it.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.630
Thank you for your service.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.830
Why...?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:36.630
I thought I'd give you one 
last role to play, you see.

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.490
The unforeseen ability and determination
of the "incompetent talented girl"...

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:49.540
The skill of her private tutor 
and his hidden background...

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:54.150
It would seem there is still 
much that I have to do.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.420
Lady Elise!

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:00.580
Instructor Rose!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.490
I was so worried!

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:04.540
Any injuries? You okay?

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.250
I'm alright.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.750
Welcome back, Instructor Kufa, Melida.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.710
I'm so very glad you're safe.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.110
I'm sorry to have worried you.

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.960
Melida, you did a great job, too.

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:17.080
Thanks!

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:18.750
Truly.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:37.450
In the following days, a number of people
claiming to be Lady Melida's true father

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.250
wrote in to the various newspapers.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:44.250
Regarding the incident that had secretly
shaken the Cardinals' Scholarship District...

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:49.880
The matter was resolved by 
Knight-Duke Serge Shicksal,

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.080
who had moved forward with
an independent investigation.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:59.130
The culprit behind the incident was a
member of Crest Legion named Bijou Niese.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:03.920
The young elite knight is considered
to have perpetrated the act of violence

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:06.810
due to harboring doubts about
the current state of the nation.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:11.770
But he has gone into hiding and the
truth of the matter remains in the dark.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:16.420
To deal with the aftermath of this crime
unprecedented in the history of Crest Legion,

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:23.040
the commander of the unit, Duke Felgus Angel,
is briefly staying with Lady Melida.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.000
Come on, get back up.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.830
Thanks.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.790
Lita?

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.710
Now, now...

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:48.830
Father!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:02.540
Regarding your Class that was shown on your
certificate for passing the labyrinth-librarian exam...

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:08.460
In your great-grandmother's generation,
there was a relative who was Samurai Class...

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.580
If I'm remembering correctly.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.960
You very much resemble Melinoa.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.830
Father...

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.990
I leave the rest to you.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:37.080
Understood.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.920
I'm happy for you, Lady Melida.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.080
Ah, look at the time!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.330
We have to hurry!

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.630
It's the opening ceremony, 
so we must get ready, too!

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.710
Milady, it's time to go.

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:36.380
Alright.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.250
You're the same color as 
my instructor, you know.

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:13.670
You're always together, aren't you?

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:24.750
Milady.

00:22:25.330 --> 00:22:26.330
Instructor!

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:44.040
For my reward for passing the certification exam,
will you hear out my selfish request?

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:46.000
Go right ahead.

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:52.880
I'd like you to see it...

00:22:53.380 --> 00:22:59.170
The moment this world, which could be said to be cruel,
acknowledges me someday.

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:07.920
Then, rather than entrusting my life to you,
I'd like to risk my life for you.

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:12.130
Ah, sure enough...

00:23:16.130 --> 00:23:18.380
She is my little lady.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:27.080
Oh, dear! If we don't hurry we'll be late!

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:31.470
